SUMMARY:The Road Eleven Band at The Penngrove Pub
DESCRIPTION:Road Eleven is a high-energy rock ‘n’ roll band from Napa Valley featuring the powerhouse trio of Chris Chesbrough on guitar and vocals\, Sue Chesbrough on bass and vocals\, and  Rick Durocher on drums with special guest Allen Chesbrough on drums. Known for their tight musicianship\, driving rhythms\, and dynamic harmonies\, Road Eleven delivers a mix of Classic Rock\, Country\, R&B and original tunes. With their infectious energy and love for performing\, they turn every show into a lively celebration of pure rock ‘n’ roll.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-road-eleven-band-at-the-penngrove-pub/
