DESCRIPTION:$25 General Admission\nDoors at 7:30pm.\nShow from 8:15-10:00pm \nPull up and tap in with a night of comedy in Santa Rosa. Ok Good Comedy Productions is bringing a solid showcase to The Lost Church. Good energy\, local talent\, some seasoned\, some rising\, all worth the watch. \nFeaturing:\nJason Cole\nIris Benson\nJake Sullivan\nAbe Rabinowitz\nCamille Cauthen\nChantavy Tornado \nHosted by Brett William Silveri \nCome laugh\, come support\, come see what the scene’s building. Doors open\, grab a seat early.
