SUMMARY:RIVETED -- Industrial/Gothic/Post-Punk/DJ
DESCRIPTION:Industrial beats\, goth energy\, and dark performance art collide at Riveted—an electrifying night of music and spectacle.\nRiveted (an Aggro Production) brings together the pulse of industrial\, goth\, and post-punk for an unforgettable night of dark dance culture. DJs Aggrofemm\, Decay\, Werkforce\, and Miss Julie spin an electrifying mix of industrial\, darkwave\, and underground club classics\, keeping the dance floor alive from 8:00pm to 12:30am.\nBetween DJ sets\, captivating performance art from Gabrial & Courtney\, Roxy Mirage\, Audrey & Christa\, and Julian Arango transforms the night into a full sensory experience. Snap a photo with the life-sized T-800 Cyborg Terminator\, grab a drink from the full bar (21+ with ID)\, and lace up your dancing boots for a night where music\, movement\, and dark artistry collide.\nThe California has a limited allotment of tickets for this event. More tickets available at https://www.eventbrite.com/e/riveted-2-tickets-1985398509387 \nTickets $14 in advance\, $18 at the door. \nDoors open 7:45pm.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/riveted-industrial-gothic-post-punk-dj/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Riveted.jpg
GEO:38.44252;-122.71621
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The California Theatre of Santa Rosa 528 7th Street Santa Rosa CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=528 7th Street:geo:-122.71621,38.44252
END:VEVENT
