SUMMARY:Mother's Day Celebration at Paradise Ridge Winery
DESCRIPTION:Mothers Day @ Paradise! Come celebrate Mom on Sunday May 10th with a variety of entertainment at Paradise Ridge Winery. Enjoy live acoustic music by Highway One Productions taking in sweeping vineyard and westerly views 1-4 PM. Unleash your inner artist and create your own hand-made Mothers Day cards with local artist Chris Patane using water colors 1-3 PM $55 includes all material and a glass of wine. All mom’s receive a free glass of our award winning sparkling rose!
