SUMMARY:A Theater For Children Presents Shrek JR - The Musical
DESCRIPTION:Shrek Jr. Brings Big Laughs and Bigger Heart to Santa Rosa Stage\nSanta Rosa\, CA — Get ready for ogre-sized fun as Shrek Jr. takes the stage this May at Kid Street Charter School Theater. This lively\, family-friendly musical brings everyone’s favorite green ogre to life in a colorful production full of humor\, heart\, and high-energy performances. \nBased on the beloved story\, Shrek Jr. follows Shrek on an unexpected adventure with fairy tale misfits\, unlikely friendships\, and a powerful message that true beauty comes from within. With catchy songs\, playful comedy\, and meaningful lessons about acceptance and belonging\, the show is designed to entertain audiences of all ages\, especially young children and their families. \nDirected by Charlie Bird\, this production showcases the talent and enthusiasm of young performers\, creating a joyful theater experience that is both inspiring and entertaining. \nPerformance Dates:\nMay 8 through 10 and May 15 through 17\nFridays: 7pm\nSaturdays: 4:30 and 7pm\nSundays: 3pm \nOnly $7 each – www.ATheaterForChildren.com \nFamilies are encouraged to attend and enjoy an affordable\, high-quality live theater experience that celebrates creativity\, confidence\, and community. \nA Theater For Children provides a creative space where young performers can explore their imagination\, build confidence\, and learn the joy of storytelling. Through teamwork and hands-on experience\, kids bring stories to life on stage while making lasting memories.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/a-theater-for-children-presents-shrek-jr-the-musical-4/
LOCATION:Kid Street Charter School Theater\, 709 Davis Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95401\, United States
CATEGORIES:Kids and Family,Theater
END:VEVENT
