SUMMARY:Smokehouse at The Elephant in the Room
DESCRIPTION:An Irish guy\, a black guy\, a Hungarian\, and a Jew\, walked into a bar. Once they were perched on their barstools\, the soulful organ master Jimmy McGriff\, streamed through the laptop speakers. “Rock Candy” was the song\, and it pleased the four men very much. So much so\, the men\, who just happened to be distinguished musicians\, decided on the spot\, to organize an organ dominate quartet\, name it SMOKEHOUSE\, and get some gigs. That’s exactly what they did\, and now the rest of the story.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/smokehouse-at-the-elephant-in-the-room/
