SUMMARY:Powerhouse Ladies Third Edition
DESCRIPTION:Powerhouse Ladies unite for a one-of-a-kind night of female-fronted music\, collaboration\, and a show-stopping finale.\nPowerhouse Ladies brings together a rotating lineup of incredible female-fronted artists for a night of collaboration\, spontaneity\, and unforgettable performances. Each show is entirely unique\, with performers trading songs\, showcasing their individual styles\, and ultimately joining forces for a powerful grand finale. Casual\, fun\, and deeply moving\, this is a celebration of women in music at its most dynamic. \nThis edition features Rebecca Roudman of Dirty Cello\, Ruby Lee Hill\, and Zoe Fitzgerald Carter. From Dirty Cello’s high-energy blend of blues\, rock\, and Americana\, to Ruby Lee Hill’s genre-spanning originals and magnetic stage presence\, to Zoe Fitzgerald Carter’s award-winning songwriting and soulful storytelling\, each artist brings a distinct voice to the stage—culminating in a collaborative experience you won’t see anywhere else. \nDoors Open: 7:00 PM | Show Starts: 7:30 PM\nTickets $28 in advance. $35 at door
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/powerhouse-ladies-third-edition/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
